<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>RefLog</title><%- include('partials-head') %></head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials-header') %>
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h1>RefLog</h1>
    <p class="sub">Keep track of every game you ref — even the ones you swap.</p>
    <div class="card-links">
      <a class="btn" href="/login">Log In</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="/signup">Create Your Profile</a>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:28px; max-width:420px; margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto;">
      This is a personal tracker — not tied to any one league. Add every game you're
      assigned across any organization you ref for, log it when you give a game away
      or pick one up from someone else, and always know exactly what's actually yours
      to work.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
